@baseUrl = http://localhost:3500/api/erp/customers

### Search ERP customers by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=ACERO&limit=10

### Search ERP customers by code
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=23&limit=10

### Search ERP customers by RFC
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=XAXX010101000&limit=10

### Monthly sales summary by taxId (exact) and date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/monthly-sales-summary?taxId=GUN061103UV0&startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31

### Monthly sales summary by customerName (LIKE) and date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/monthly-sales-summary?customerName=GUNDERSON&startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31

### Monthly sales summary by taxId + customerName + date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/monthly-sales-summary?taxId=GUN061103UV0&customerName=GUNDERSON&startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31
